 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/06/27 04:00| 00 | 117| 012| 0573| 0021| 0542| 0595|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/06/27 02:36| 04 | 325| 052| 0220| 0019| 0195| 0257|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/06/27 00:48| 01 | 282| 014| 0206| 0003| 0200| 0210|    \n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/06/26 23:48| 02 | 157| 012| 0286| 0108| 0208| 0526|    \n  <a href=\"CME0018/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0018</a>|2026/06/26 20:00| 05 | 201| 136| 0262| 0048| 0185| 0374|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0017/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0017</a>|2026/06/26 18:48| 01 | 118| 014| 066"
